会に依頼を出そうとしていたところだったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[745150102]},{"nodeId":745150102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1686067754,"text":"#依頼が自分からやってくるなんてな。へへ、{NICKNAME}、今夜はご馳走が食べられそうだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[745150103]},{"nodeId":745150103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3086389570,"text":"コホン、パイモン…","nextNodeIds":[745150104]},{"nodeId":745150104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":614255578,"text":"あっ…オイラが言いたかったのは、オイラたちみたいな有名な冒険者は、それなりのギャラがいるぜってことだ。","nextNodeIds":[745150105]},{"nodeId":745150105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1276001970,"text":"報酬のことなら心配しないでくれ。前回と同じように頼んだ実験をこなしてくれれば、然るべき報酬を支払おう！","nextNodeIds":[745150106]},{"nodeId":745150106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2203680338,"text":"ぜ、前回？えーと…どっかで会ったっけ…？","nextNodeIds":[745150107]},{"nodeId":745150107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":75807490,"text":"はぁ…まだ覚えてくれていないのか？スメール教令院の学者、ホッセイニだ。これまで何度も手伝ってくれただろう？","nextNodeIds":[745150108]},{"nodeId":745150108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":505430818,"text":"ご…ごめん。まったく記憶になくて…","nextNodeIds":[745150109]},{"nodeId":745150109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1913171322,"text":"「エネルギー原盤」のことも忘れたか？","nextNodeIds":[745150110,745150111]},{"nodeId":745150110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1151531210,"text":"もしかして、「原盤マン」？","nextNodeIds":[745150113]},{"nodeId":745150113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2459984682,"text":"「原盤マン」？あっ、思い出したぞ。前に離島と層岩巨淵で会ったよな！","nextNodeIds":[745150114]},{"nodeId":745150114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1545564442,"text":"っていうか、おまえすごく変わってないか？なんか、雰囲気が明るくなったような…全然わからなかったぞ。","nextNodeIds":[745150115]},{"nodeId":745150115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3566414754,"text":"はは、そう見えるか？ここ最近、気分がすこぶるいいんだ。これほど運に恵まれたのは実に久しぶりでな。","nextNodeIds":[745150116]},{"nodeId":745150116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3341858210,"text":"おお！何かいいことがあったのか？オイラたちにも教えてくれよ！","nextNodeIds":[745150117]},{"nodeId":745150117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2963448778,"text":"話せば長くなるんだが…実は前回君たちと別れた後、教令院に戻ったんだ。そして、集めたデータを基に、人工エネルギー原盤の構想をまとめて提出した。","nextNodeIds":[745150118]},{"nodeId":745150118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1909233994,"text":"レポートを読んだ指導教員は興奮を隠せない様子で、その場で「惜しみない賞賛」を贈ってくださった。それから…","nextNodeIds":[745150119]},{"nodeId":745150119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1775951802,"text":"それから…？","nextNodeIds":[745150120]},{"nodeId":745150120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1586216346,"text":"指導教員にスメールを追い出されて、フォンテーヌにやってきたのさ。今はここで指導教員に与えられた課題をやっている。","nextNodeIds":[745150121]},{"nodeId":745150121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1406299506,"text":"えっ？でも「賞賛」されたんじゃないのかよ？","nextNodeIds":[745150122]},{"nodeId":745150122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":247054218,"text":"ああ、よくもファンタジー小説の類を研究テーマとして提出したなと、私の勇気を讃えてくださったんだ。","nextNodeIds":[745150123]},{"nodeId":745150123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":664596450,"text":"全然褒められてないじゃないか…","nextNodeIds":[745150124]},{"nodeId":745150124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2268580434,"text":"私も最初はひどく落ち込んでいた。だがその後、フォンテーヌで優秀な協力者や投資者に出会ってな。私のプロジェクトを大いに気に入ってくれたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[745150125]},{"nodeId":745150125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3540609882,"text":"彼らの協力のもと、これまでの研究成果とフォンテーヌの技術を融合させ、ついに人工エネルギー原盤のプロトタイプを造ることに成功した。その名も「ホッセイニ原盤」だ。","nextNodeIds":[745150126]},{"nodeId":745150126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1900163682,"text":"「ホッセイニ原盤」の実験が計算通りにうまくいけば、知恵の神の試練はもとより…賢者になることだって夢じゃない！","nextNodeIds":[745150127]},{"nodeId":745150127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3972388298,"text":"まだ卒業してないの？","nextNodeIds":[745150128]},{"nodeId":745150128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1392199466,"text":"コホン、そんなことは無意味で紛らわしいだけの変数だ。成功の前段階にある、些細な挫折に過ぎないさ。","nextNodeIds":[745150129]},{"nodeId":745150129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":50758194,"text":"目下の急務は、「ホッセイニ原盤」のパフォーマンスを検証すること。だから、秘境に入ってこれを使った後、評価してくれる人を雇おうとしたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[745150130]},{"nodeId":745150130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":164534714,"text":"#ということで、{NICKNAME}、今回の「ホッセイニ原盤」の実験プロジェクトに参加してくれないだろうか？","nextNodeIds":[745150131,745150133]},{"nodeId":745150131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2629129618,"text":"つまり、それを使って戦うんだよね？","nextNodeIds":[745150132]},{"nodeId":745150132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3431942954,"text":"その通りだ。君の優れた戦闘能力は承知しているが、今のところまだ「ホッセイニ原盤」は想定レベルに達していなくてな。くれぐれも安全には気をつけてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745150133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2716211570,"text":"了解。任せて！","nextNodeIds":[745150134]},{"nodeId":745150134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1564821410,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、君の優れた戦闘能力は承知しているが、現時点で「ホッセイニ原盤」はまだ想定レベルに達していなくてな。くれぐれも安全には気をつけてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":745150111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3137763026,"text":"それも記憶にないかも…","nextNodeIds":[745150112]},{"nodeId":745150112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2906285570,"text":"なら「原盤マン」は？これなら覚えているだろう？","nextNodeIds":[745150113]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7451501,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7451501],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30611,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","count":18},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":6}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3273937382,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Fontaine_74515/Q7451501","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPEMGNO":false,"DBACCKDPONG":[],"DIAFFIANKPH":false,"DKOMBMCJMMN":false,"EFBOKHEHKJM":[],"EIDINNIHMHD":false,"EKANPNMEFMG":[],"ENDBMMDPPAH":[],"FALLCBHGKON":"LOGIC_NONE","GEPGLHFDBNF":[],"GLJMLHNKKKO":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","HJFLPAICAEO":false,"HNFEAICLPLM":[],"HPPIPDNHFJG":false,"IBGGIIDBOAG":false,"IEFDIICF